Drive Vocabulary Book / 云端词汇本

This project is a derivative of Vocabulary Notebook by Eric Zhou:
https://github.com/Eric-Zhou-0302/vocabulary-notebook
Upstream base: 173b2887265439a9fd578a351babf0be61181cfa
Original license: MIT, as stated in the upstream README.

The upstream FastAPI application, React interface, AI vocabulary prompt,
FSRS implementation, exports, and regression tests form the foundation.
The original Git history is retained. See docs/UPSTREAM_README.md.

Ruoyu-Tianyi's extensions add Google Drive synchronization, multiple notebooks,
immutable learning histories, conflict-safe merging, DeepSeek API configuration,
Windows startup, and sync/backup settings. This is an independently maintained
derivative; no affiliation with or endorsement by the upstream author is implied.
